 boards for endless fun, including 9 Premium Packs and 12 months of daily challenges.\\r\\n• Gameplay-enhancing options like Hints, Shuffle, and Zoom.\\r\\n• Earn coins for each completed board.\\r\\n• Collect stars as you clear boards.\\r\\n• Global competition with online leaderboards—challenge friends and players worldwide.\\r\\n• Exclusive touch controls for a seamless experience.\\r\\n• Beautifully hand-crafted tiles and backgrounds.\\r\\n• Relaxing lo-fi ambient background music for a calming atmosphere.", "developer": "Max Interactive Studio", "external": {"metacritic": {"id": "1400798075"}}, "image": {}, "platforms": ["Nintendo Switch"], "publisher": "Max Interactive Studio", "release_date": "2024-11-15", "release_year": 2024, "short_description": "A strategic puzzle game featuring over 1,100 levels, blending Mahjong with chess-like depth in a relaxing environment.", "short_descriptions": [{"language": "de", "value": "Ein strategisches Puzzlespiel mit über 1.100 Levels, das Mahjong mit schachähnlicher Tiefe in einer entspannenden Umgebung verbindet."}, {"language": "es", "value": "Un juego de rompecabezas estratégico con más de 1,100 niveles, que combina Mahjong con profundidad tipo ajedrez en un ambiente relajante."}, {"language": "fr", "value": "Un jeu de puzzle stratégique avec plus de 1 100 niveaux, mêlant Mahjong à une profondeur proche des échecs dans un cadre relaxant."}, {"language": "en", "value": "A strategic puzzle game featuring over 1,100 levels, blending Mahjong with chess-like depth in a relaxing environment."}]}, "popularity": 0.9799869783439857, "disambiguation": "2024-11-15, Max Interactive Studio", "tags": [{"name": "Board", "tag_id": "urn:tag:genre:media:board", "type": "urn:tag:genre:media", "value": "urn:tag:genre:media:board"}]}, {"name": "Spike II: The Great Emu War", "entity_id": "76F1E180-C521-4D71-8AAA-37ED268589BA", "types": ["urn:entity:videogame"], "properties": {"akas": [], "content_rating": "", "description": "He is back.\\n\\